  (20056,'pc-l6a',6,'drill','Examples',null,null,'recognition','mc','peek',null,null,null,'This is the usual pattern though not every sentence will have all of these parts. Some will not have an object; others will not have a location/direction or beneficiary. Sometimes modifiers or time cues are also added.'),
